      "type": "math",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 91,
      "raw": "$$\n\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial \\mathbf{o}}\n= \\text{prod}\\left(\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial L}, \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{o}}\\right)\n= \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{o}}\n\\in \\mathbb{R}^q.\n$$",
