      "raw": "$$\n\\frac{\\partial s}{\\partial \\mathbf{W}^{(1)}} = \\lambda \\mathbf{W}^{(1)}\n\\; \\text{and} \\;\n\\frac{\\partial s}{\\partial \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}} = \\lambda \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}.\n$$",
