      "line": 110,
      "raw": "$$\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}}= \\text{prod}\\left(\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial \\mathbf{o}}, \\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{o}}{\\partial \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}}\\right) + \\text{prod}\\left(\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial s}, \\frac{\\partial s}{\\partial \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}}\\right)= \\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial \\mathbf{o}} \\mathbf{h}^\\top + \\lambda \\mathbf{W}^{(2)}.$$",
